## Files

- `parcels.parquet`: GeoParquet with every feature and its public fields. Open it with DuckDB, GeoPandas, QGIS or any GeoParquet reader.
- `parcels.pmtiles`: PMTiles vector tiles for web maps (tile layer `layer`).
- `style.json`: a MapLibre style that draws the tiles.
- `AGENTS.md`: the fields, the coordinate system and ready-to-run queries.
